>二、使用指南\n</h1></div><div><h1>1 任务类型-普通<img src=\"/profile/upload/2023/06/19/202306191656132470003.png\" style=\"font-size: 14px; max-width: 100%;\"></h1></div><div><h1>2 任务类型-阶段计划类\n</h1></div><div>阶段计划类型的任务主要通过共享文档的方式实现各单位年度计划的收集和统计，网络安全管理人员向下属单位下发全年度工作计划，跟进下属单位年度工作计划的进度与月度反馈内容，提升对整体工作计划与业务落实的监管能力；下属单位反馈年度工作计划内容与指标，并于每月上报具体工作计划和指标。</div><div></div><div><h1>二、使用指南\n</h1></div><div><h1>1 任务类型-普通\n</h1></div><div><h1>2 任务类型-阶段计划类\n</h1></div><div>阶段计划类型的任务主要通过共享文档的方式实现各单位年度计划的收集和统计，网络安全管理人员向下属单位下发全年度工作计划，跟进下属单位年度工作计划的进度与月度反馈内容，提升对整体工作计划与业务落实的监管能力；下属单位反馈年度工作计划内容与指标，并于每月上报具体工作计划和指标。<img src=\"/profile/upload/2023/06/19/202306191655253810000.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"><img src=\"/profile/upload/2023/06/19/202306191655401630001.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div>',NULL,'{\"timeType\":\"0\",\"dateStart\":\"\",\"dateEnd\":\"\",\"recentlyTime\":\"\"}',NULL,'colorgroup16','','1','1','4','3',NULL,0,'',NULL,'0619富文本测试20619富文本测试20619富文本测试20619富文本测试20619富文本测试20619富文本测试20619富文本测试20619富文本测试20619富文本测试20619富文本测试2','super','管理员','2023-06-19 16:56:32','super','2023-06-19 16:56:32','100','1','100','','',1,NULL,0),('20230620142147550008','S-000608','[SZC安全运营中心] 集权系统被攻击情况_近5条','table','sql','','SELECT\n        tar.id,\n        tar.business_key AS businessKey,\n        tar.alarm_id AS alarmId,\n        tar.title,\n        tar.`level`,\n        tar.level_label AS levelLabel,\n        tar.attack_result AS attackResult,\n        tar.attack_result_label AS attackResultLabel,\n        tar.attack_means AS attackMeans,\n        tar.attack_means_label AS attackMeansLabel,\n        ta.internal_ip AS internalIp,\n        ta.`instance`\nFROM\n        tb_alarm_report tar\nINNER JOIN (\n        SELECT\n                a.id,\n                SUBSTRING_INDEX(SUBSTRING_INDEX(a.`victimized_ip`, \',\', b.help_topic_id), \',\',-1 ) AS ip\n        FROM\n                tb_alarm_report a\n        LEFT JOIN mysql.help_topic b ON\n                b.help_topic_id <= (LENGTH( a.`victimized_ip`) - LENGTH(REPLACE(a.`victimized_ip`, \',\', \'\')) + 1 )\n                AND b.help_topic_id > 0\n        WHERE\n                a.del_flag = \'0\'\n                AND a.`level` IN (1, 2)\n                AND a.order_status IN (\'研判\', \'处置\', \'审核\')) t1 ON\n                tar.id = t1.id\nINNER JOIN tb_asset ta ON\n        t1.ip = ta.internal_ip\nWHERE\n        ta.del_flag = \'0\'\n        AND ta.centralized_system = \'1\'\n        AND EXISTS (\n        SELECT\n                1\n        FROM\n                (\n                SELECT\n                        a.id,\n                        SUBSTRING_INDEX(SUBSTRING_INDEX(a.`victimized_ip`, \',\', b.help_topic_id), \',\',-1 ) AS ip\n                FROM\n                        tb_alarm_report a\n                LEFT JOIN mysql.help_topic b ON\n                        b.help_topic_id <= (LENGTH( a.`victimized_ip`) - LENGTH(REPLACE(a.`victimized_ip`, \',\', \'\')) + 1 )\n                        AND b.help_topic_id > 0\n                WHERE\n                        a.del_flag = \'0\'\n                        AND a.`level` IN (1, 2)\n                        AND a.order_status IN (\'研判\', \'处置\', \'审核\')\n                        AND a.create_time BETWEEN DATE_FORMAT(\'${dateStart<2023-05-01 00:00:00>}\', \'%Y-%m-%d %H:%i:%S\') \n                  AND DATE_FORMAT(\'${dateEnd<2023-05-01 00:00:00>}\', \'%Y-%m-%d %H:%i:%S\')) t3\n        INNER JOIN (\n                SELECT\n                        ta.internal_ip\n                FROM\n                        tb_asset ta\n                WHERE\n                        ta.del_flag = \'0\'\n                        AND ta.centralized_system = \'1\') t4 ON\n                t3.ip = t4.internal_ip\n        WHERE\n                tar.id = t3.id\n        )\nORDER BY\n        tar.create_time DESC\nLIMIT 5',NULL,'{\"timeType\":\"0\",\"dateStart\":\"\",\"dateEnd\":\"\",\"recentlyTime\":\"\"}',NULL,'colorgroup16','','1','1','4','3',NULL,0,'',NULL,NULL,'super','管理员','2023-06-20 14:21:47','super','2023-06-20 16:26:34','100','1','100','','',1,NULL,0),('202306201456314660000','S-000597','ES日志接收数量','count','dsl','','{\"query\":{\"match_all\":{}}}',NULL,'{\"timeType\":\"0\",\"dateStart\":\"\",\"dateEnd\":\"\",\"recentlyTime\":\"\"}',NULL,'colorgroup16','','1','1','4','3',NULL,0,'sec_all*',NULL,NULL,'super','管理员','2023-06-20 14:56:31','super','2023-06-20 14:56:31','100','1','100','','',1,NULL,0),('202307181602099650009','S-000636','c测试图片显示','richText','','','<h1><span style=\"color: rgb(194, 79, 74);\">c测试图片显示</span></h1><p>c测试图片显示<br></p><p>c测试图片显示<br></p><p><img src=\"/profile/upload/2023/07/18/202307181601409470008.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><br></p><p>测试图片显示</p><p><img src=\"https://std_stp_dev.crc.com.cn/profile/upload/2023/07/18/202307181601409470008.png\"><br></p><p><img src=\"https://std_stp_dev.crc.com.cn/profile/upload/2023/07/18/202307181601409470008.png\"><br></p>',NULL,'{\"timeType\":\"0\",\"dateStart\":\"\",\"dateEnd\":\"\",\"recentlyTime\":\"\"}',NULL,'colorgroup16','','1','1','4','3',NULL,0,'',NULL,NULL,'super','管理员','2023-07-18 16:02:10','super','2023-07-18 16:02:10','100','1','100','','',1,NULL,0),('202307271632563550001','S-000636','富文本','richText','','','<p><img src=\"/profile/upload/2023/07/27/202307271632546120000.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"><br></p>',NULL,'{\"timeType\":\"0\",\"dateStart\":\"\",\"dateEnd\":\"\",\"recentlyTime\":\"\"}',NULL,'colorgroup16','','1','1','4','3',NULL,0,'',NULL,NULL,'super','管理员','2023-07-27 16:32:56','super','2023-07-27 16:32:56','100','1','100','','',1,NULL,0),('202308161519332870003','S-000599','[SCP] 域名TOP5_域名告警趋势','area','dsl','','{\n  \"aggs\": {\n    \"name\": {\n      \"date_histogram\": {\n        \"field\": \"SparkTime\",\n        \"fixed_interval\": \"1d\",\n        \"time_zone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n        \"min_doc_count\": 0,\n        \"extended_bounds\": {\n          \"min\": \"${startTime<2023-06-06T08:41:50.371+0800>}\",\n          \"max\": \"${endTime<2023-06-07T09:41:50.371+0800>}\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"size\": 0,\n  \"query\": {\n    \"bool\": {\n      \"must\": [],\n      \"filter\": [\n        {\n          \"bool\": {\n            \"filter\": [\n              {\n                \"bool\": {\n                  \"should\": [\n                    {\n                      \"match_phrase\": {\n                        \"src_ip_type.keyword\": \"外网\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ],\n                  \"minimum_should_match\": 1\n                }\n              },\n              {\n                \"bool\": {\n                  \"should\": [\n                    {\n                      \"match_phrase\": {\n                        \"host.keyword\": \"${host<runworkauth.crc.com.cn>}\"\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ],\n                  \"minimum_should_match\": 1\n                }\n              },\n              {\n                \"bool\": {\n                  \"filter\": [\n                    {\n                      \"bool\": {\n                        \"should\": [\n                          {\n                            \"match_phrase\": {\n                              \"dest_ip_type.keyword\": \"内网\"\n                            }\n                          }\n                        ],\n                        \"minimum_should_match\": 1\n                      }\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"bool\": {\n                        \"filter\": [\n                          {\n                            \"bool\": {\n                              \"should\": [\n                                {\n                                  \"bool\": {\n                                    \"filter\": [\n                                      {\n                                        \"bool\": {\n                                          \"should\": [\n                                            {\n                                              \"match_phrase\": {\n                                                \"product.keyword\": \"奇安信天眼\"\n                                              }\n                                            }\n                                          ],\n                                          \"minimum_should_match\": 1\n                                        }\n                                      },\n                                      {\n                                        \"bool\": {\n                                          \"must_not\": {\n                                            \"bool\": {\n                                              \"should\": [\n                                                {\n                                                  \"match_phrase\": {\n                                                    \"action_top.keyword\": \"恶意软件\"\n                                                  }\n                                                }\n                                              ],\n                                              \"minimum_should_match\": 1\n                                            }\n                                          }\n                                        }\n                                      }\n                                    ]\n                                  }\n                                },\n                                {\n                                  \"bool\": {\n                                    \"should\": [\n                                      {\n                                        \"match_phrase\": {\n                                          \"product.keyword\": \"长亭Waf\"\n                                        }\n                                      }\n                                    ],\n                                    \"minimum_should_match\": 1\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              ],\n                              \"minimum_should_match\": 1\n                            }\n                          },\n                          {\n                            \"bool\": {\n                              \"must_not\": {\n                                \"bool\": {\n                                  \"should\": [\n                                    {\n                                      \"match_phrase\": {\n                                        \"log_level.keyword\": \"低风险\"\n                                      }\n                                    }\n                                  ],\n                                  \"minimum_should_match\": 1\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        ]\n                      }\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"range\": {\n            \"SparkTime\": {\n              \"gte\": \"${startTime<2023-06-06T08:41:50.371+0800>}\",\n              \"lte\": \"${endTime<2023-06-07T09:41:50.371+0800>}\",\n              \"format\": \"strict_date_optional_time\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"should\": [],\n      \"must_not\": []\n    }\n  }\n}',NULL,'{\"timeType\":\"0\",\"dateStart\":\"\",\"dateEnd\":\"\",\"recentlyTime\":\"\"}','{\"labelPosition\":\"top\",\"xaxisLabelRotate\":30,\"gridBottom\":\"20%\",\"legendData\":\"受攻击次数\",\"smooth\":true,\"xAxisFormat\":{\"type\":\"date\",\"format\":\"yyyy-MM-dd\"}}','colorgroup16','','1','1','4','3',NULL,0,'sec_all*',NULL,NULL,'super','管理员','2023-08-16 15:19:33','super','2023-09-25 16:33:40','100','1','100','','',1,NULL,0),('202308170947268030013','S-000569','柱状图测试动态','bar','static','','[{\"name\":\"Australia\",\"child\":\"2021\",\"count\":397},{\"name\":\"Australia\",\"child\":\"2022\",\"count\":457},{\"name\":\"Australia\",\"child\":\"2023\",\"count\":657},{\"name\":\"Australia\",\"child\":\"2024\",\"count\":353},\n{\"name\":\"China\",\"child\":\"2021\",\"count\":497},{\"name\":\"China\",\"child\":\"2022\",\"count\":517},{\"name\":\"China\",\"child\":\"2023\",\"count\":557},{\"name\":\"China\",\"child\":\"2024\",\"count\":657},\n{\"name\":\"Jp\",\"child\":\"2021\",\"count\":417},{\"name\":\"Jp\",\"child\":\"2022\",\"count\":417},{\"name\":\"Jp\",\"child\":\"2023\",\"count\":357},{\"name\":\"Jp\",\"child\":\"2024\",\"count\":397}]',NULL,'{\"timeType\":\"0\",\"dateStart\":\"\",\"dateEnd\":\"\",\"recentlyTime\":\"\"}','{\"animation\":true,\"frequency\":\"6000\"}','colorgroup16','','1','1','4','3',NULL,0,'',NULL,NULL,'super','管理员','2023-08-17 09:47:27','super','2023-08-17 20:30:54','100','1','100','','',1,NULL,0),('202308171435253340014','S-000629','【SCP】实战效率看板-实战告警数据研判及时率趋势','area','sql','','SELECT \n  IFNULL( (judgeCount - judgeOver) / judgeCount * 100 , 0 )  AS COUNT,\n  create_time AS NAME\nFROM\n  ( SELECT SUM(1) AS judgeCount , SUM(judgeSubtract) AS judgeOver, create_time FROM (SELECT \n      id,\n      CASE\n        WHEN judgeTimeConsuming - judgeTimeLimit &gt; 0 \n        THEN 1 \n        ELSE 0 \n      END AS judgeSubtract,\n      create_time\n    FROM\n      (SELECT \n        r.id,\n        DATE_FORMAT(r.create_time, \'%Y-%m-%d\')  AS create_time,\n        IFNULL(\n          hps.judge_time_consuming,\n          (\n            UNIX_TIMESTAMP(NOW()) - UNIX_TIMESTAMP(hps.create_time)\n          )\n        ) AS judgeTimeConsuming,\n        (SELECT \n          remark \n        FROM\n          sys_dict_data \n        WHERE dict_type = \'combat_time_limit\' \n          AND dict_value = \'judge_time_limit\') AS judgeTimeLimit\n      FROM\n        tb_alarm_combat_report r \n        LEFT JOIN tb_alarm_combat_process_sla hps \n          ON r.id = hps.alarm_report_id\n	  WHERE r.del_flag = 0 AND r.fight_period_type = \'${fightPeriodType&lt;updateTest&gt;}\' \n		AND r.organization_id = \'${organizationId&lt;100&gt;}\'\n		  ) a ) b GROUP BY create_time \n		  ) c',NULL,'{\"timeType\":\"0\",\"dateStart\":\"\",\"dateEnd\":\"\",\"recentlyTime\":\"\"}','{\"labelPosition\":\"top\",\"gridBottom\":\"20%\",\"xaxisLabelRotate\":20,\"legendData\":\"研判及时率%\",\"smooth\":true,\"yAxisUnit\":\"%\"}','colorgroup9','','1','1','4','3',NULL,0,'',NULL,NULL,'super','管理员','2023-08-17 14:35:25','super','2023-08-17 16:15:00','100','1','100','','',1,NULL,0),('202308171435314060015','S-000630','【SCP】实战效率看板-实战告警数据处置及时率趋势','area','sql','','SELECT \n  IFNULL( (dealCount - dealOver) / dealCount * 100 , 0 )AS COUNT,\n  create_time AS NAME\nFROM\n  (SELECT \n    SUM(dealSubtract) AS dealOver,\n    COUNT(1) AS dealCount , create_time\n  FROM\n    (SELECT \n      id,\n      CASE\n        WHEN dealTimeConsuming - dealTimeLimit &gt; 0 \n        THEN 1 \n        ELSE 0 \n      END AS dealSubtract,\n	  create_time\n    FROM\n      (SELECT \n        r.id,\n		DATE_FORMAT(r.create_time, \'%Y-%m-%d\')  AS create_time,\n        IF(\n          ISNULL(hps.judge_time),\n          0,\n          IFNULL(\n            hps.deal_time_consuming,\n            (\n              UNIX_TIMESTAMP(NOW()) - UNIX_TIMESTAMP(hps.judge_time)\n            )\n          )\n        ) AS dealTimeConsuming,\n        (SELECT \n          remark \n        FROM\n          sys_dict_data \n        WHERE dict_type = \'combat_time_limit\' \n          AND dict_value = \'deal_time_limit\') AS dealTimeLimit \n      FROM\n        tb_alarm_combat_report r \n        LEFT JOIN tb_alarm_combat_process_sla hps \n          ON r.id = hps.alarm_report_id\n	  WHERE r.del_flag = 0 \n		AND r.fight_period_type = \'${fightPeriodType&lt;updateTest&gt;}\' \n		AND r.organization_id = \'${organizationId&lt;100&gt;}\'  \n		  ) a) b GROUP BY create_time \n		  ) c',NULL,'{\"timeType\":\"0\",\"dateStart\":\"\",\"dateEnd\":\"\",\"recentlyTime\":\"\"}','{\"labelPosition\":\"top\",\"gridBottom\":\"20%\",\"xaxisLabelRotate\":20,\"legendData\":\"处置及时率%\",